# Optional. Copy the token from `claude setup-token` into .devcontainer/.env:
#
#   CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=your-token
#
# The token uses your Claude subscription (Pro, Max, Ultra, Team or Enterprise) and is valid for
# one year. Without it, run `claude` in the container and sign in in the browser once.
# .env is git-ignored. Anything in the container, this token included, is readable by the code
# you run there: only open repos you trust.
